>Severe bleeding quick card
Press firmly and continuously. Call emergency services (UK: 999).
Use a dressing, cloth or hand. Leave embedded objects in place and press around them. If pressure fails to stop life-threatening limb bleeding, use a commercial tourniquet if trained or directed. Note the time and do not release it. Keep the person warm and check breathing.

